  "prompt": "Act as a fresh Adversarial Critic over an immutable Chain Synthesis artifact.\nCurrent research attacker scope permits only unauthenticated attackers and subscriber-equivalent low-privilege users. Treat customer as a known subscriber-equivalent role, and treat a custom role as subscriber-equivalent only when its effective capabilities do not exceed the built-in Subscriber baseline. Do not discover, retain, deepen, validate, or hand off a route whose minimum starting attacker is Contributor or higher or unresolved. A route may escalate privileges after starting within the permitted scope.\nUse the Manifest-bound source tools to independently challenge attacker premise, actor, state identity, request ordering, defenses, causal hops, and source binding.\nDisposition every proposal exactly once as survives, needs-evidence, or contradicted.\nA needs-evidence disposition must name one concrete Frontier Gap with a falsifier and next source action.\nDo not add semantic edges, produce a Finding or Verification verdict, schedule work, or change Family state.\nChain synthesis context: {\"attempt\":{\"attemptId\":\"root-synthesizer:9cbf73b71eb9b049c101d2dba3f20fdee32f61c08532321fd5b29588a64b4ca0\",\"digest\":\"sha256:bb1fa45282a32aed447e0ca6a7dc41fa871d9503fdd107a62262a6f2fefd7cb1\",\"kind\":\"attempt-execution-result\",\"owner\":\"exploration\",\"planDigest\":\"sha256:8c82bd33c2cb82f8ac320eae66fdb50f729fe98edb45cd3134d05c5350620a7f\",\"role\":\"root-synthesizer\",\"schemaVersion\":2},\"batchId\":\"sha256:2b8425b1be948348542f97433fcddc8f9ba7bc66ccdd64f683426a091df723ab\",\"id\":\"sha256:6d06fa7a66e9992f501f140debdcb87bbbca6f5ab09e974a091825e7b275761a\",\"itemDispositions\":[{\"disposition\":\"used\",\"itemId\":\"sha256:d983225011e7ae101e367d6eefb2639d2dd1b578d9047f9f92e4c550e81b9183\",\"reason\":\"The hypothesis and fragment form a composable route.\"}],\"kind\":\"chain-synthesis\",\"manifest\":{\"digest\":\"sha256:5bc7d01ba1ead41c3fa15922a250f3a525c34533378b806240